<title>ROMANIA: Romania producer prices 52.6 pct up in March.</title>
<headline>Romania producer prices 52.6 pct up in March.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian industry rose by 52.6 percent in March after a 17 percent increase in February, National Statistics Board (CNS) data showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Producer prices were 186.5 percent up year-on-year in March.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	MARCH 97   FEB 97  MARCH 96</p>
<p> mth/mth change		     +52.6    +17.0	+2.8</p>
<p>  extraction industry	    +198.9     +2.6	+5.1</p>
<p>  processing industry	     +32.5    +20.0	+2.9</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	+160.2     +0.1	+0.1</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
